+/* 
+ * SpacesPage.css - Enhanced with source design architecture integration
+ * 
+ * Design elements integrated from source:
+ * 
+ * 1. FONT FAMILIES - Direct integration from source global.css:
+ *    - Kavoon-Regular: Used for hero titles (brand personality)
+ *    - Figtree-Regular: Used for body text and navigation
+ *    - Figtree-SemiBold: Used for space titles and descriptions
+ *    - Figtree-ExtraBold: Used for active navigation states
+ *    - Sacramento-Regular: Used for main logo (elegant script)
+ *    - Edu QLD Beginner-Regular: Used for logo subtitle
+ * 
+ * 2. COLOR SCHEME - Earth tone palette from source:
+ *    - #f0eee4: Primary text color (warm off-white)
+ *    - #41461d: Button backgrounds (deep earth green)
+ *    - #e1d2a826: Frame overlays (subtle tropical wash)
+ *    - #ffffff: High contrast text elements
+ *    - Preserved original #3a3a3a for base background
+ * 
+ * 3. BACKDROP FILTER EFFECTS - Glass morphism from source:
+ *    - blur(6.0px) with saturation/hue adjustments for frames
+ *    - blur(4.5px) for buttons and navigation elements
+ *    - Inset box shadows for depth and glass effect
+ * 
+ * 4. LAYOUT STRUCTURE - Frame-based architecture:
+ *    - Added spaces-frame container with backdrop effects
+ *    - Maintained responsive grid system from target
+ *    - Enhanced hero section with overlay effects
+ * 
+ * 5. TYPOGRAPHY HIERARCHY - Source font sizing and weights:
+ *    - Hero titles: 5rem Kavoon-Regular with text shadow
+ *    - Space titles: 2.2rem Figtree-SemiBold
+ *    - Body text: 1.1rem Figtree variants
+ *    - Navigation: 1.1rem Figtree-Regular with shadows
+ * 
+ * 6. BUTTON STYLING - Source design with backdrop effects:
+ *    - 45px border radius (more rounded than original)
+ *    - #41461d33 background with backdrop blur
+ *    - Inset shadows for glass morphism effect
+ *    - Preserved Ionic button functionality
+ */
